---
description: Enforce repository-wide Python unit-test coverage
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md`. For each Python change, add deterministic tests and run:

```powershell
python -m coverage run --branch -m pytest
python -m coverage json -o coverage.json
python scripts/check_coverage.py --coverage-file coverage.json --threshold 90
python -m coverage report --fail-under=90
```

The scope is every `app/**/*.py` file. Statements, branches, and functions must each be at least 90% for every file and in aggregate. The global pytest timeout is 60 seconds. Mock external services and mark live tests as `integration` or `manual`; do not hide application code with coverage exclusions.
